-- statement:
--   Verbatim transplant of the Lean module `CKLaneC2R.Cells.S00.B003` of the machine-checked proof of the general Courtade–Kumar theorem (the most informative Boolean function conjecture), so that the complete proof can be verified on this platform.
--
